{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-00","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-00"},"source":["# P10.6-AI — Notebook 58: split interno foraminal\n","\n","Construye el split interno para **estrechamiento foraminal neural izquierdo y derecho** sobre series **Sagittal T1**, usando el manifiesto aprobado por el Notebook 57.\n","\n","El split se realiza exclusivamente por `study_id`. Primero audita el split común del Notebook 54; si no conserva adecuadamente los estratos foraminales raros, busca de forma reproducible un split específico multilabel.\n","\n","No entrena modelos, no descarga DICOM y no accede al test oficial.\n","\n","`humanReviewRequired=true` · `notClinicalDiagnosis=true` · `officialTestAccessed=false`\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-01","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-01"},"source":["## Recursos y permisos\n","\n","- Runtime recomendado: **Colab estándar con CPU**.\n","- GPU: no requerida.\n","- Kaggle token: no requerido.\n","- GitHub token: no requerido; el repositorio es público.\n","- Autorizar Google Drive.\n","- Ejecutar previamente el Notebook 57 y conservar sus artefactos en Drive.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-02","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-02"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 1) Imports\n","from __future__ import annotations\n","\n","import hashlib\n","import json\n","import os\n","import shutil\n","import subprocess\n","import sys\n","from datetime import datetime, timezone\n","from pathlib import Path\n","\n","import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","\n","print({\n","    \"python\": sys.version.split()[0],\n","    \"numpy\": np.__version__,\n","    \"pandas\": pd.__version__,\n","    \"gpuRequired\": False,\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-03","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-03"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 2) Montar Drive y resolver la rama\n","from google.colab import drive  # type: ignore\n","\n","drive.mount(\"/content/drive\", force_remount=False)\n","\n","REPO_URL = (\n","    \"https://github.com/EnzoAA004/\"\n","    \"PFI_MVPTest_Enzo_AImodule.git\"\n",")\n","REPO_ROOT = Path(\"/content/PFI_MVPTest_Enzo_AImodule\")\n","REPO_REF = \"enzo/p10-6-ai-rsna-findings\"\n","\n","if not (REPO_ROOT / \".git\").exists():\n","    subprocess.check_call([\n","        \"git\", \"clone\",\n","        \"--branch\", REPO_REF,\n","        \"--single-branch\",\n","        REPO_URL,\n","        str(REPO_ROOT),\n","    ])\n","else:\n","    subprocess.check_call(\n","        [\"git\", \"fetch\", \"origin\", REPO_REF],\n","        cwd=REPO_ROOT,\n","    )\n","    subprocess.check_call(\n","        [\"git\", \"checkout\", REPO_REF],\n","        cwd=REPO_ROOT,\n","    )\n","    subprocess.check_call(\n","        [\"git\", \"pull\", \"--ff-only\", \"origin\", REPO_REF],\n","        cwd=REPO_ROOT,\n","    )\n","\n","REPO_SHA = subprocess.check_output(\n","    [\"git\", \"rev-parse\", \"HEAD\"],\n","    cwd=REPO_ROOT,\n","    text=True,\n",").strip()\n","\n","sys.path.insert(0, str(REPO_ROOT / \"ai_service\"))\n","from pfi_ai_service.training.rsna_preflight import (\n","    atomic_write_json,\n","    atomic_write_text,\n","    sha256_file,\n",")\n","\n","print({\"repoRef\": REPO_REF, \"repoSha\": REPO_SHA})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-04","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-04"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 3) Rutas y configuración reproducible\n","PFI_ROOT = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive/PFI_MVP\")\n","RESULTS_ROOT = PFI_ROOT / \"results\" / \"P10_6_rsna_findings\"\n","\n","NOTEBOOK57_ROOT = RESULTS_ROOT / \"notebook57_foraminal_preflight\"\n","SOURCE_MANIFEST = NOTEBOOK57_ROOT / \"foraminal_candidate_manifest.csv\"\n","SOURCE_SUMMARY = NOTEBOOK57_ROOT / \"foraminal_preflight_summary.json\"\n","\n","NOTEBOOK54_ROOT = RESULTS_ROOT / \"notebook54_split\"\n","COMMON_STUDY_SPLITS = NOTEBOOK54_ROOT / \"study_splits.csv\"\n","\n","OUTPUT_ROOT = RESULTS_ROOT / \"notebook58_foraminal_split\"\n","OUTPUT_ROOT.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","\n","SEED = 2026\n","N_CANDIDATE_SPLITS = 2000\n","TRAIN_FRACTION = 0.70\n","VALIDATION_FRACTION = 0.15\n","INTERNAL_TEST_FRACTION = 0.15\n","FRACTION_TOLERANCE = 0.01\n","\n","SPLIT_ORDER = (\"train\", \"validation\", \"internal_test\")\n","SPLIT_FRACTIONS = {\n","    \"train\": TRAIN_FRACTION,\n","    \"validation\": VALIDATION_FRACTION,\n","    \"internal_test\": INTERNAL_TEST_FRACTION,\n","}\n","SIDES = (\"left\", \"right\")\n","LEVELS = (\"L1-L2\", \"L2-L3\", \"L3-L4\", \"L4-L5\", \"L5-S1\")\n","SEVERITIES = (\"normal_mild\", \"moderate\", \"severe\")\n","\n","if abs(sum(SPLIT_FRACTIONS.values()) - 1.0) > 1e-12:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Las fracciones del split no suman 1.\")\n","\n","print({\n","    \"sourceManifest\": str(SOURCE_MANIFEST),\n","    \"commonSplitCandidate\": str(COMMON_STUDY_SPLITS),\n","    \"outputRoot\": str(OUTPUT_ROOT),\n","    \"candidateSplits\": N_CANDIDATE_SPLITS,\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-05","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-05"},"source":["## Política del split\n","\n","Se intenta mantener un split común entre los modelos RSNA para facilitar comparaciones pareadas. Sin embargo, el split del Notebook 54 fue estratificado para estenosis central y puede no conservar los pocos casos foraminales `Severe` de niveles superiores.\n","\n","El Notebook 58 lo audita con reglas explícitas. Solo crea una cohorte específica si el split común falla. El conjunto `internal_test` queda sellado para una única evaluación final en el Notebook 60.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-06","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-06"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 4) Verificar la fuente aprobada por Notebook 57\n","required_source_files = [SOURCE_MANIFEST, SOURCE_SUMMARY]\n","missing_source_files = [\n","    str(path) for path in required_source_files if not path.is_file()\n","]\n","if missing_source_files:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\n","        \"Faltan artefactos del Notebook 57:\\n- \"\n","        + \"\\n- \".join(missing_source_files)\n","    )\n","\n","with SOURCE_SUMMARY.open(\"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as handle:\n","    source_summary = json.load(handle)\n","\n","if source_summary.get(\"approved\") is not True:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"El Notebook 57 no está aprobado.\")\n","if source_summary.get(\"nextNotebook\") != 58:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"El Notebook 57 no habilita el Notebook 58.\")\n","if source_summary.get(\"governance\", {}).get(\n","    \"officialTestAccessed\"\n",") is not False:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"La fuente declara acceso al test oficial.\")\n","\n","source_manifest_sha256 = sha256_file(SOURCE_MANIFEST)\n","expected_manifest_sha256 = (\n","    source_summary.get(\"outputSha256\", {}).get(\"manifest\")\n",")\n","if (\n","    expected_manifest_sha256\n","    and source_manifest_sha256 != expected_manifest_sha256\n","):\n","    raise RuntimeError({\n","        \"error\": \"source_manifest_hash_mismatch\",\n","        \"expected\": expected_manifest_sha256,\n","        \"observed\": source_manifest_sha256,\n","    })\n","\n","print({\n","    \"sourceApproved\": True,\n","    \"sourceManifestSha256\": source_manifest_sha256,\n","    \"sourceRows\": source_summary.get(\"targetRows\"),\n","    \"sourceUsableRows\": source_summary.get(\"usableRows\"),\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-07","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-07"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 5) Cargar, normalizar y validar el manifiesto\n","manifest = pd.read_csv(\n","    SOURCE_MANIFEST,\n","    dtype={\n","        \"study_id\": str,\n","        \"coordinate_series_id\": str,\n","    },\n",")\n","\n","required_columns = {\n","    \"study_id\", \"side\", \"level\", \"severity\", \"severity_code\",\n","    \"usable_for_split\", \"coordinate_series_id\",\n","    \"coordinate_instance_number\", \"coordinate_x\", \"coordinate_y\",\n","}\n","missing_columns = sorted(required_columns - set(manifest.columns))\n","if missing_columns:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\n","        f\"Faltan columnas requeridas: {missing_columns}\"\n","    )\n","\n","def parse_boolean(series: pd.Series) -> pd.Series:\n","    return (\n","        series.astype(str)\n","        .str.strip()\n","        .str.lower()\n","        .isin({\"true\", \"1\", \"yes\"})\n","    )\n","\n","manifest[\"usable_for_split\"] = parse_boolean(\n","    manifest[\"usable_for_split\"]\n",")\n","manifest[\"study_id\"] = manifest[\"study_id\"].astype(str)\n","manifest[\"severity_code\"] = pd.to_numeric(\n","    manifest[\"severity_code\"], errors=\"coerce\"\n",")\n","\n","usable = manifest.loc[manifest[\"usable_for_split\"]].copy()\n","excluded = manifest.loc[~manifest[\"usable_for_split\"]].copy()\n","\n","if usable.empty:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"No hay filas utilizables.\")\n","if usable[\"severity\"].isna().any():\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Hay severidades nulas entre filas utilizables.\")\n","if usable[\"severity_code\"].isna().any():\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Hay códigos de severidad nulos.\")\n","if usable[\n","    [\"study_id\", \"side\", \"level\"]\n","].duplicated().any():\n","    raise RuntimeError(\n","        \"Hay claves study_id-side-level duplicadas.\"\n","    )\n","if not usable[\"side\"].isin(SIDES).all():\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Lateralidad inesperada.\")\n","if not usable[\"level\"].isin(LEVELS).all():\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Nivel inesperado.\")\n","if not usable[\"severity\"].isin(SEVERITIES).all():\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Severidad inesperada.\")\n","\n","print({\n","    \"manifestRows\": int(len(manifest)),\n","    \"usableRows\": int(len(usable)),\n","    \"excludedRows\": int(len(excluded)),\n","    \"usableStudies\": int(usable[\"study_id\"].nunique()),\n","    \"allSourceStudies\": int(manifest[\"study_id\"].nunique()),\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-08","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-08"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 6) Construir matriz multilabel por study_id\n","usable[\"label_key\"] = (\n","    usable[\"side\"].astype(str)\n","    + \"__\" + usable[\"level\"].astype(str)\n","    + \"__\" + usable[\"severity\"].astype(str)\n",")\n","\n","expected_label_keys = [\n","    f\"{side}__{level}__{severity}\"\n","    for side in SIDES\n","    for level in LEVELS\n","    for severity in SEVERITIES\n","]\n","\n","label_matrix = (\n","    usable.assign(present=1)\n","    .pivot_table(\n","        index=\"study_id\",\n","        columns=\"label_key\",\n","        values=\"present\",\n","        aggfunc=\"max\",\n","        fill_value=0,\n","    )\n","    .reindex(columns=expected_label_keys, fill_value=0)\n","    .astype(np.int8)\n","    .sort_index()\n",")\n","\n","observed_nonzero = set(\n","    label_matrix.columns[label_matrix.sum(axis=0) > 0]\n",")\n","if observed_nonzero != set(expected_label_keys):\n","    raise RuntimeError({\n","        \"missingNonzeroStrata\": sorted(\n","            set(expected_label_keys) - observed_nonzero\n","        ),\n","        \"unexpectedStrata\": sorted(\n","            observed_nonzero - set(expected_label_keys)\n","        ),\n","    })\n","\n","study_stats = (\n","    usable.groupby(\"study_id\")\n","    .agg(\n","        max_severity_code=(\"severity_code\", \"max\"),\n","        severe_count=(\n","            \"severity_code\",\n","            lambda values: int((values == 2).sum()),\n","        ),\n","        moderate_count=(\n","            \"severity_code\",\n","            lambda values: int((values == 1).sum()),\n","        ),\n","        usable_rows=(\"severity_code\", \"size\"),\n","    )\n","    .reindex(label_matrix.index)\n",")\n","study_stats[\"abnormal_count\"] = (\n","    study_stats[\"severe_count\"]\n","    + study_stats[\"moderate_count\"]\n",")\n","\n","def primary_stratum(row: pd.Series) -> str:\n","    max_severity = int(row[\"max_severity_code\"])\n","    severe_count = int(row[\"severe_count\"])\n","    abnormal_count = int(row[\"abnormal_count\"])\n","    severe_bucket = (\n","        0 if severe_count == 0\n","        else 1 if severe_count == 1\n","        else 2\n","    )\n","    abnormal_bucket = (\n","        0 if abnormal_count == 0\n","        else 1 if abnormal_count <= 2\n","        else 2 if abnormal_count <= 5\n","        else 3\n","    )\n","    return (\n","        f\"m{max_severity}\"\n","        f\"_s{severe_bucket}\"\n","        f\"_a{abnormal_bucket}\"\n","    )\n","\n","study_stats[\"primary_stratum\"] = study_stats.apply(\n","    primary_stratum, axis=1\n",")\n","primary_counts = study_stats[\n","    \"primary_stratum\"\n",'].value_counts()\n","\n","if int(primary_counts.min()) < 6:\n","    raise RuntimeError({\n","        \"error\": \"primary_stratum_too_small\",\n","        \"counts\": primary_counts.to_dict(),\n","    })\n","\n","display(primary_counts.rename(\"studies\").to_frame())\n","print({\n","    \"studyMatrix\": list(label_matrix.shape),\n","    \"labelStrata\": int(label_matrix.shape[1]),\n","    \"minimumPrimaryStratum\": int(primary_counts.min()),\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-09","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-09"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 7) Funciones de auditoría y scoring\n","study_ids = label_matrix.index.to_numpy(dtype=str)\n","y = label_matrix.to_numpy(dtype=np.int8)\n","label_totals = y.sum(axis=0).astype(int)\n","label_names = np.array(label_matrix.columns, dtype=object)\n","indices = np.arange(len(study_ids))\n","primary_values = study_stats.loc[\n","    study_ids, \"primary_stratum\"\n","] .to_numpy()\n","\n","split_index = {\n","    name: index for index, name in enumerate(SPLIT_ORDER)\n","}\n","target_fraction_vector = np.array([\n","    SPLIT_FRACTIONS[name] for name in SPLIT_ORDER\n","])\n","\n","def support_rule(total: int) -> str:\n","    if total >= 6:\n","        return \"all_three_splits\"\n","    if total >= 3:\n","        return \"train_and_at_least_two_splits\"\n","    if total == 2:\n","        return \"train_and_one_holdout\"\n","    return \"train_only\"\n","\n","def support_passes(counts: np.ndarray, total: int) -> bool:\n","    train_count, validation_count, test_count = map(int, counts)\n","    nonzero_splits = int(np.count_nonzero(counts))\n","    if total >= 6:\n","        return bool(np.all(counts > 0))\n","    if total >= 3:\n","        return train_count > 0 and nonzero_splits >= 2\n","    if total == 2:\n","        return (\n","            train_count > 0\n","            and (validation_count + test_count) > 0\n","        )\n","    return train_count > 0\n","\n","def evaluate_count_matrix(\n","    count_matrix: np.ndarray,\n",") -> tuple[float, dict, pd.DataFrame]:\n","    expected = (\n","        label_totals[:, None]\n","        * target_fraction_vector[None, :]\n","    )\n","    absolute_error = np.abs(count_matrix - expected)\n","    rarity_weight = 1.0 / np.maximum(\n","        np.sqrt(label_totals), 1.0\n","    )\n","    severe_weight = np.where(\n","        np.char.endswith(label_names.astype(str), \"__severe\"),\n","        2.0,\n","        1.0,\n","    )\n","    weights = rarity_weight * severe_weight\n","    base_score = float(np.mean(\n","        absolute_error\n","        / np.maximum(np.sqrt(label_totals[:, None]), 1.0)\n","        * weights[:, None]\n","    ))\n","\n","    rows = []\n","    support_ok = []\n","    for label_index, label_name in enumerate(label_names):\n","        counts = count_matrix[label_index]\n","        total = int(label_totals[label_index])\n","        passed = support_passes(counts, total)\n","        support_ok.append(passed)\n","        rows.append({\n","            \"label_key\": str(label_name),\n","            \"total_support\": total,\n","            \"train\": int(counts[0]),\n","            \"validation\": int(counts[1]),\n","            \"internal_test\": int(counts[2]),\n","            \"support_rule\": support_rule(total),\n","            \"support_rule_passed\": bool(passed),\n","        })\n","\n","    rare_report = pd.DataFrame(rows)\n","    failed_count = int((~rare_report[\n","        \"support_rule_passed\"\n","    ]).sum())\n","    penalty = float(failed_count * 1000.0)\n","    return (\n","        base_score + penalty,\n","        {\n","            \"baseDistributionScore\": base_score,\n","            \"failedSupportRules\": failed_count,\n","            \"supportRulesPassed\": failed_count == 0,\n","        },\n","        rare_report,\n","    )\n","\n","def counts_from_assignment(\n","    assignment: pd.Series,\n",") -> np.ndarray:\n","    missing = sorted(set(study_ids) - set(assignment.index))\n","    if missing:\n","        raise RuntimeError(\n","            f\"Assignment incompleto: faltan {len(missing)} estudios.\"\n","        )\n","    values = assignment.loc[study_ids].astype(str).to_numpy()\n","    return np.stack([\n","        y[values == split_name].sum(axis=0)\n","        for split_name in SPLIT_ORDER\n","    ], axis=1).astype(int)\n","\n","def assignment_gates(\n","    assignment: pd.Series,\n","    count_matrix: np.ndarray,\n","    score_details: dict,\n",") -> dict:\n","    assignment = assignment.loc[study_ids].astype(str)\n","    sizes = assignment.value_counts()\n","    fractions = sizes / len(assignment)\n","    valid_split_names = set(assignment.unique()) == set(\n","        SPLIT_ORDER\n","    )\n","    fraction_ok = all(\n","        abs(float(fractions.get(split_name, 0.0))\n","            - SPLIT_FRACTIONS[split_name])\n","        <= FRACTION_TOLERANCE\n","        for split_name in SPLIT_ORDER\n","    )\n","\n","    global_class_ok = {}\n","    for severity in SEVERITIES:\n","        columns = [\n","            index\n","            for index, name in enumerate(label_names)\n","            if str(name).endswith(f\"__{severity}\")\n","        ]\n","        global_class_ok[severity] = all(\n","            int(count_matrix[columns, split_index[name]].sum()) > 0\n","            for name in SPLIT_ORDER\n","        )\n","\n","    return {\n","        \"allEligibleStudiesAssigned\": (\n","            len(assignment) == len(study_ids)\n","            and not assignment.index.duplicated().any()\n","        ),\n","        \"validSplitNames\": valid_split_names,\n","        \"fractionTolerance\": fraction_ok,\n","        \"supportRulesPassed\": bool(\n","            score_details[\"supportRulesPassed\"]\n","        ),\n","        \"allSeverityClassesInEverySplit\": bool(\n","            all(global_class_ok.values())\n","        ),\n","        \"globalSeverityCoverage\": global_class_ok,\n","    }\n","\n","def audit_assignment(\n","    assignment: pd.Series,\n",") -> dict:\n","    assignment = assignment.loc[\n","        assignment.index.intersection(study_ids)\n","    ].copy()\n","    complete = set(assignment.index) == set(study_ids)\n","    if not complete:\n","        return {\n","            \"available\": True,\n","            \"complete\": False,\n","            \"approved\": False,\n","            \"missingStudies\": int(\n","                len(set(study_ids) - set(assignment.index))\n","            ),\n","        }\n","\n","    count_matrix = counts_from_assignment(assignment)\n","    score, score_details, rare_report = (\n","        evaluate_count_matrix(count_matrix)\n","    )\n","    gates = assignment_gates(\n","        assignment, count_matrix, score_details\n","    )\n","    approved = all(\n","        value\n","        for key, value in gates.items()\n","        if key != \"globalSeverityCoverage\"\n","    )\n","    return {\n","        \"available\": True,\n","        \"complete\": True,\n","        \"approved\": bool(approved),\n","        \"score\": float(score),\n","        \"scoreDetails\": score_details,\n","        \"gates\": gates,\n","        \"countMatrix\": count_matrix,\n","        \"rareReport\": rare_report,\n","    }\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-10","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-10"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 8) Auditar el split común del Notebook 54\n","common_audit = {\n","    \"available\": False,\n","    \"approved\": False,\n","    \"reason\": \"study_splits.csv_not_found\",\n","}\n","common_assignment = None\n","\n","if COMMON_STUDY_SPLITS.is_file():\n","    common_frame = pd.read_csv(\n","        COMMON_STUDY_SPLITS,\n","        dtype={\"study_id\": str},\n","    )\n","    if not {\"study_id\", \"split\"}.issubset(common_frame.columns):\n","        common_audit = {\n","            \"available\": True,\n","            \"approved\": False,\n","            \"reason\": \"required_columns_missing\",\n","        }\n","    elif common_frame[\"study_id\"].duplicated().any():\n","        common_audit = {\n","            \"available\": True,\n","            \"approved\": False,\n","            \"reason\": \"duplicate_study_ids\",\n","        }\n","    else:\n","        common_assignment = common_frame.set_index(\n","            \"study_id\"\n","        )[\"split\"].astype(str)\n","        common_audit = audit_assignment(common_assignment)\n","\n","print({\n","    key: value\n","    for key, value in common_audit.items()\n","    if key not in {\"countMatrix\", \"rareReport\"}\n","})\n","\n","if common_audit.get(\"available\") and common_audit.get(\"complete\"):\n","    failed_common_strata = common_audit[\n","        \"rareReport\"\n","    ].loc[\n","        ~common_audit[\"rareReport\"][\"support_rule_passed\"]\n","    ]\n","    display(failed_common_strata)\n","else:\n","    print(\"No hay split común completo para reutilizar.\")\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-11","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-11"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 9) Reutilizar el split común o buscar uno foraminal específico\n","def candidate_from_seed(\n","    candidate_seed: int,\n",") -> tuple[pd.Series, np.ndarray]:\n","    train_positions, holdout_positions = train_test_split(\n","        indices,\n","        test_size=(\n","            VALIDATION_FRACTION\n","            + INTERNAL_TEST_FRACTION\n","        ),\n","        random_state=candidate_seed,\n","        stratify=primary_values,\n","    )\n","    validation_positions, test_positions = train_test_split(\n","        holdout_positions,\n","        test_size=(\n","            INTERNAL_TEST_FRACTION\n","            / (\n","                VALIDATION_FRACTION\n","                + INTERNAL_TEST_FRACTION\n","            )\n","        ),\n","        random_state=candidate_seed + 100_000,\n","        stratify=primary_values[holdout_positions],\n","    )\n","\n","    values = np.empty(len(study_ids), dtype=object)\n","    values[train_positions] = \"train\"\n","    values[validation_positions] = \"validation\"\n","    values[test_positions] = \"internal_test\"\n","\n","    count_matrix = np.stack([\n","        y[values == split_name].sum(axis=0)\n","        for split_name in SPLIT_ORDER\n","    ], axis=1).astype(int)\n","\n","    assignment = pd.Series(\n","        values,\n","        index=study_ids,\n","        name=\"split\",\n","    )\n","    return assignment, count_matrix\n","\n","search_summary = {\n","    \"performed\": False,\n","    \"candidateCount\": 0,\n","    \"approvedCandidateCount\": 0,\n","    \"bestSeed\": None,\n","    \"bestScore\": None,\n","}\n","\n","if common_audit.get(\"approved\") is True:\n","    selected_assignment = common_assignment.loc[study_ids].copy()\n","    selected_audit = common_audit\n","    split_policy = \"reused_notebook54_common_split\"\n","else:\n","    split_policy = \"task_specific_multilabel_search\"\n","    search_summary[\"performed\"] = True\n","    best = None\n","\n","    for offset in range(N_CANDIDATE_SPLITS):\n","        candidate_seed = SEED + offset\n","        candidate_assignment, candidate_counts = (\n","            candidate_from_seed(candidate_seed)\n","        )\n","        score, score_details, rare_report = (\n","            evaluate_count_matrix(candidate_counts)\n","        )\n","        gates = assignment_gates(\n","            candidate_assignment,\n","            candidate_counts,\n","            score_details,\n","        )\n","        candidate_approved = all(\n","            value\n","            for key, value in gates.items()\n","            if key != \"globalSeverityCoverage\"\n","        )\n","        search_summary[\"candidateCount\"] += 1\n","\n","        if not candidate_approved:\n","            continue\n","\n","        search_summary[\"approvedCandidateCount\"] += 1\n","        if best is None or score < best[\"score\"]:\n","            best = {\n","                \"seed\": candidate_seed,\n","                \"score\": score,\n","                \"assignment\": candidate_assignment,\n","                \"countMatrix\": candidate_counts,\n","                \"scoreDetails\": score_details,\n","                \"rareReport\": rare_report,\n","                \"gates\": gates,\n","            }\n","\n","    if best is None:\n","        raise RuntimeError(\n","            \"No se encontró un split que supere los gates.\"\n","        )\n","\n","    selected_assignment = best[\"assignment\"]\n","    selected_audit = {\n","        \"available\": True,\n","        \"complete\": True,\n","        \"approved\": True,\n","        \"score\": float(best[\"score\"]),\n","        \"scoreDetails\": best[\"scoreDetails\"],\n","        \"gates\": best[\"gates\"],\n","        \"countMatrix\": best[\"countMatrix\"],\n","        \"rareReport\": best[\"rareReport\"],\n","    }\n","    search_summary[\"bestSeed\"] = int(best[\"seed\"])\n","    search_summary[\"bestScore\"] = float(best[\"score\"])\n","\n","print({\n","    \"splitPolicy\": split_policy,\n","    \"selectedApproved\": selected_audit[\"approved\"],\n","    \"selectedScore\": selected_audit[\"score\"],\n","    **search_summary,\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-12","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-12"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 10) Construir assignments y manifests finales\n","eligible_assignments = (\n","    selected_assignment\n","    .rename(\"split\")\n","    .rename_axis(\"study_id\")\n","    .reset_index()\n",")\n","eligible_assignments[\"eligible_for_model\"] = True\n","eligible_assignments[\"exclusion_reason\"] = \"\"\n","\n","all_source_studies = pd.Index(\n","    sorted(manifest[\"study_id\"].unique()),\n","    name=\"study_id\",\n",")\n","excluded_study_ids = all_source_studies.difference(\n","    eligible_assignments[\"study_id\"]\n",")\n","excluded_assignments = pd.DataFrame({\n","    \"study_id\": excluded_study_ids.astype(str),\n","    \"split\": \"excluded_no_usable_rows\",\n","    \"eligible_for_model\": False,\n","    \"exclusion_reason\": \"no_usable_foraminal_targets\",\n","})\n","\n","study_assignments = (\n","    pd.concat(\n","        [eligible_assignments, excluded_assignments],\n","        ignore_index=True,\n","    )\n","    .sort_values([\"eligible_for_model\", \"split\", \"study_id\"],\n","                 ascending=[False, True, True])\n","    .reset_index(drop=True)\n",")\n","\n","assigned_manifest = usable.merge(\n","    eligible_assignments[[\"study_id\", \"split\"]],\n","    on=\"study_id\",\n","    how=\"left\",\n","    validate=\"many_to_one\",\n",")\n","if assigned_manifest[\"split\"].isna().any():\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Hay filas utilizables sin split.\")\n","\n","assigned_manifest[\"internal_test_sealed\"] = (\n","    assigned_manifest[\"split\"].eq(\"internal_test\")\n",")\n","assigned_manifest[\"human_review_required\"] = True\n","assigned_manifest[\"not_clinical_diagnosis\"] = True\n","assigned_manifest[\"official_test_accessed\"] = False\n","\n","train_manifest = assigned_manifest.loc[\n","    assigned_manifest[\"split\"].eq(\"train\")\n","].copy()\n","validation_manifest = assigned_manifest.loc[\n","    assigned_manifest[\"split\"].eq(\"validation\")\n","].copy()\n","internal_test_manifest = assigned_manifest.loc[\n","    assigned_manifest[\"split\"].eq(\"internal_test\")\n","].copy()\n","\n","split_manifests = {\n","    \"train\": train_manifest,\n","    \"validation\": validation_manifest,\n","    \"internal_test\": internal_test_manifest,\n","}\n","\n","print({\n","    split_name: {\n","        \"studies\": int(frame[\"study_id\"].nunique()),\n","        \"rows\": int(len(frame)),\n","    }\n","    for split_name, frame in split_manifests.items()\n","})\n","print({\n","    \"excludedStudies\": int(len(excluded_study_ids)),\n","    \"internalTestSealed\": True,\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-13","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-13"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 11) Distribuciones, rare strata y leakage\n","distribution = (\n","    assigned_manifest.groupby(\n","        [\"side\", \"level\", \"severity\", \"split\"]\n","    )\n","    .size()\n","    .reset_index(name=\"count\")\n",")\n","stratum_totals = (\n","    assigned_manifest.groupby(\n","        [\"side\", \"level\", \"severity\"]\n","    )\n","    .size()\n","    .reset_index(name=\"total_support\")\n",")\n","distribution = distribution.merge(\n","    stratum_totals,\n","    on=[\"side\", \"level\", \"severity\"],\n","    how=\"left\",\n","    validate=\"many_to_one\",\n",")\n","distribution[\"target_fraction\"] = distribution[\n","    \"split\"\n",'].map(SPLIT_FRACTIONS)\n","distribution[\"expected_count\"] = (\n","    distribution[\"total_support\"]\n","    * distribution[\"target_fraction\"]\n",")\n","distribution[\"observed_fraction\"] = (\n","    distribution[\"count\"]\n","    / distribution[\"total_support\"]\n",")\n","distribution[\"deviation_percentage_points\"] = (\n","    distribution[\"observed_fraction\"]\n","    - distribution[\"target_fraction\"]\n",") * 100.0\n","\n","rare_strata_report = selected_audit[\n","    \"rareReport\"\n","].copy()\n","rare_strata_report[[\"side\", \"level\", \"severity\"]] = (\n","    rare_strata_report[\"label_key\"]\n","    .str.split(\"__\", expand=True)\n",")\n","rare_strata_report = rare_strata_report[[\n","    \"side\", \"level\", \"severity\", \"label_key\",\n","    \"total_support\", \"train\", \"validation\",\n","    \"internal_test\", \"support_rule\",\n","    \"support_rule_passed\",\n","]]\n","\n","split_coverage = pd.DataFrame([\n","    {\n","        \"split\": split_name,\n","        \"studies\": int(frame[\"study_id\"].nunique()),\n","        \"rows\": int(len(frame)),\n","        \"study_fraction\": (\n","            frame[\"study_id\"].nunique()\n","            / len(study_ids)\n","        ),\n","        \"row_fraction\": len(frame) / len(assigned_manifest),\n","    }\n","    for split_name, frame in split_manifests.items()\n","])\n","\n","study_sets = {\n","    split_name: set(frame[\"study_id\"].astype(str))\n","    for split_name, frame in split_manifests.items()\n","}\n","pairwise_overlap = {\n","    \"train_validation\": sorted(\n","        study_sets[\"train\"] & study_sets[\"validation\"]\n","    ),\n","    \"train_internal_test\": sorted(\n","        study_sets[\"train\"] & study_sets[\"internal_test\"]\n","    ),\n","    \"validation_internal_test\": sorted(\n","        study_sets[\"validation\"]\n","        & study_sets[\"internal_test\"]\n","    ),\n","}\n","leakage_detected = any(pairwise_overlap.values())\n","\n","row_key_columns = [\"study_id\", \"side\", \"level\"]\n","duplicate_rows = int(\n","    assigned_manifest[row_key_columns].duplicated().sum()\n",")\n","rows_conserved = (\n","    len(train_manifest)\n","    + len(validation_manifest)\n","    + len(internal_test_manifest)\n","    == len(usable)\n",")\n","\n","leakage_report = {\n","    \"studyLeakageDetected\": bool(leakage_detected),\n","    \"pairwiseOverlapCounts\": {\n","        name: len(values)\n","        for name, values in pairwise_overlap.items()\n","    },\n","    \"duplicateStudySideLevelRows\": duplicate_rows,\n","    \"eligibleRowsConserved\": bool(rows_conserved),\n","    \"eligibleSourceRows\": int(len(usable)),\n","    \"assignedRows\": int(len(assigned_manifest)),\n","    \"internalTestSealed\": True,\n","    \"officialTestAccessed\": False,\n","}\n","\n","display(split_coverage)\n","display(rare_strata_report)\n","print(json.dumps(\n","    leakage_report,\n","    indent=2,\n","    ensure_ascii=False,\n","))\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-14","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-14"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 12) Gates finales\n","selected_gates = selected_audit[\"gates\"]\n","\n","gate_results = {\n","    \"sourceNotebook57Approved\": (\n","        source_summary.get(\"approved\") is True\n","    ),\n","    \"sourceManifestHashVerified\": (\n","        not expected_manifest_sha256\n","        or source_manifest_sha256\n","        == expected_manifest_sha256\n","    ),\n","    \"allEligibleStudiesAssigned\": bool(\n","        selected_gates[\"allEligibleStudiesAssigned\"]\n","    ),\n","    \"validSplitNames\": bool(\n","        selected_gates[\"validSplitNames\"]\n","    ),\n","    \"fractionTolerance\": bool(\n","        selected_gates[\"fractionTolerance\"]\n","    ),\n","    \"supportRulesPassed\": bool(\n","        selected_gates[\"supportRulesPassed\"]\n","    ),\n","    \"allSeverityClassesInEverySplit\": bool(\n","        selected_gates[\n","            \"allSeverityClassesInEverySplit\"\n","        ]\n","    ),\n","    \"noStudyLeakage\": not leakage_detected,\n","    \"rowsConserved\": bool(rows_conserved),\n","    \"noDuplicateStudySideLevelRows\": duplicate_rows == 0,\n","    \"internalTestSealed\": True,\n","    \"officialTestAccessed\": False,\n","    \"humanReviewRequired\": True,\n","    \"notClinicalDiagnosis\": True,\n","}\n","\n","approved = all([\n","    gate_results[\"sourceNotebook57Approved\"],\n","    gate_results[\"sourceManifestHashVerified\"],\n","    gate_results[\"allEligibleStudiesAssigned\"],\n","    gate_results[\"validSplitNames\"],\n","    gate_results[\"fractionTolerance\"],\n","    gate_results[\"supportRulesPassed\"],\n","    gate_results[\"allSeverityClassesInEverySplit\"],\n","    gate_results[\"noStudyLeakage\"],\n","    gate_results[\"rowsConserved\"],\n","    gate_results[\"noDuplicateStudySideLevelRows\"],\n","    gate_results[\"internalTestSealed\"],\n","    gate_results[\"officialTestAccessed\"] is False,\n","    gate_results[\"humanReviewRequired\"],\n","    gate_results[\"notClinicalDiagnosis\"],\n","])\n","\n","print(json.dumps(\n","    gate_results,\n","    indent=2,\n","    ensure_ascii=False,\n","))\n","print({\n","    \"status\": (\n","        \"APPROVED_FOR_NOTEBOOK_59\"\n","        if approved\n","        else \"SPLIT_REVIEW_REQUIRED\"\n","    ),\n","    \"splitPolicy\": split_policy,\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-15","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-15"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 13) Exportar evidencia auditable\n","def atomic_write_csv(path: Path, frame: pd.DataFrame) -> None:\n","    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","    temporary = path.parent / f\".{path.name}.tmp\"\n","    try:\n","        frame.to_csv(temporary, index=False)\n","        os.replace(temporary, path)\n","    finally:\n","        if temporary.exists():\n","            temporary.unlink()\n","\n","paths = {\n","    \"trainManifest\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"train_manifest.csv\",\n","    \"validationManifest\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"validation_manifest.csv\",\n","    \"internalTestManifest\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"internal_test_manifest.csv\",\n","    \"studyAssignments\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"study_split_assignments.csv\",\n","    \"splitDistribution\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"split_distribution.csv\",\n","    \"rareStrata\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"rare_strata_report.csv\",\n","    \"splitCoverage\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"split_coverage.csv\",\n","    \"leakageReport\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"split_leakage_report.json\",\n","    \"summary\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"split_summary.json\",\n","    \"report\": OUTPUT_ROOT / \"split_report.md\",\n","}\n","\n","atomic_write_csv(paths[\"trainManifest\"], train_manifest)\n","atomic_write_csv(\n","    paths[\"validationManifest\"], validation_manifest\n",")\n","atomic_write_csv(\n","    paths[\"internalTestManifest\"], internal_test_manifest\n",")\n","atomic_write_csv(\n","    paths[\"studyAssignments\"], study_assignments\n",")\n","atomic_write_csv(\n","    paths[\"splitDistribution\"], distribution\n",")\n","atomic_write_csv(paths[\"rareStrata\"], rare_strata_report)\n","atomic_write_csv(paths[\"splitCoverage\"], split_coverage)\n","atomic_write_json(paths[\"leakageReport\"], leakage_report)\n","\n","common_audit_export = {\n","    key: value\n","    for key, value in common_audit.items()\n","    if key not in {\"countMatrix\", \"rareReport\"}\n","}\n","if isinstance(\n","    common_audit_export.get(\"score\"),\n","    (np.floating, np.integer),\n","):\n","    common_audit_export[\"score\"] = float(\n","        common_audit_export[\"score\"]\n","    )\n","\n","summary = {\n","    \"schemaVersion\": \"pfi.rsna-foraminal-split.v1\",\n","    \"ticket\": \"P10.6-AI\",\n","    \"notebook\": 58,\n","    \"createdAtUtc\": datetime.now(\n","        timezone.utc\n","    ).isoformat(),\n","    \"repoRef\": REPO_REF,\n","    \"repoSha\": REPO_SHA,\n","    \"dataset\": \"RSNA_LumbarDISC\",\n","    \"task\": \"neural_foraminal_narrowing\",\n","    \"sequence\": \"Sagittal T1\",\n","    \"sourceNotebook\": 57,\n","    \"sourceManifest\": SOURCE_MANIFEST.name,\n","    \"sourceManifestSha256\": source_manifest_sha256,\n","    \"splitPolicy\": split_policy,\n","    \"seed\": SEED,\n","    \"fractions\": SPLIT_FRACTIONS,\n","    \"fractionTolerance\": FRACTION_TOLERANCE,\n","    \"eligibleStudies\": int(len(study_ids)),\n","    \"excludedStudies\": int(len(excluded_study_ids)),\n","    \"eligibleRows\": int(len(usable)),\n","    \"splits\": {\n","        split_name: {\n","            \"studies\": int(frame[\"study_id\"].nunique()),\n","            \"rows\": int(len(frame)),\n","        }\n","        for split_name, frame in split_manifests.items()\n","    },\n","    \"commonSplitAudit\": common_audit_export,\n","    \"candidateSearch\": search_summary,\n","    \"selectedDistributionScore\": float(\n","        selected_audit[\"score\"]\n","    ),\n","    \"gateResults\": gate_results,\n","    \"approved\": bool(approved),\n","    \"nextNotebook\": 59 if approved else None,\n","    \"governance\": {\n","        \"commercialUse\": False,\n","        \"humanReviewRequired\": True,\n","        \"notClinicalDiagnosis\": True,\n","        \"autonomousDiagnosis\": False,\n","        \"officialTestAccessed\": False,\n","        \"internalTestSealed\": True,\n","        \"internalTestPurpose\": (\n","            \"single_final_evaluation_not_model_selection\"\n","        ),\n","    },\n","    \"limitations\": [\n","        \"No model was trained.\",\n","        \"No DICOM pixels were downloaded or inspected.\",\n","        \"Extremely rare strata cannot be represented in all three splits.\",\n","        \"The internal test split must remain unused during Notebook 59.\",\n","        \"The output is for assisted research and not clinical diagnosis.\",\n","    ],\n","}\n","\n","report_lines = [\n","    \"# P10.6-AI — Split foraminal RSNA\",\n","    \"\",\n","    \"Split por `study_id` para estrechamiento foraminal \"\n","    \"izquierdo/derecho sobre Sagittal T1.\",\n","    \"\",\n","    f\"- Estado: `{'APPROVED_FOR_NOTEBOOK_59' if approved else 'SPLIT_REVIEW_REQUIRED'}`\",\n","    f\"- Política seleccionada: `{split_policy}`\",\n","    f\"- Estudios elegibles: {len(study_ids)}\",\n","    f\"- Estudios excluidos sin filas utilizables: {len(excluded_study_ids)}\",\n","    f\"- Filas elegibles: {len(usable)}\",\n","    \"\",\n","    \"## Cohortes\",\n","    \"\",\n","]\n","for split_name, frame in split_manifests.items():\n","    report_lines.append(\n","        f\"- {split_name}: \"\n","        f\"{frame['study_id'].nunique()} estudios, \"\n","        f\"{len(frame)} filas\"\n","    )\n","\n","report_lines.extend([\n","    \"\",\n","    \"## Gates\",\n","    \"\",\n","])\n","for name, result in gate_results.items():\n","    report_lines.append(\n","        f\"- {name}: `{str(result).lower()}`\"\n","    )\n","\n","report_lines.extend([\n","    \"\",\n","    \"## Decisión metodológica\",\n","    \"\",\n","    (\n","        \"Se reutilizó el split común del Notebook 54 porque \"\n","        \"también superó los gates foraminales.\"\n","        if split_policy == \"reused_notebook54_common_split\"\n","        else\n","        \"El split común del Notebook 54 no preservó todos los \"\n","        \"estratos foraminales requeridos. Se seleccionó un split \"\n","        \"específico mediante búsqueda multilabel reproducible.\"\n","    ),\n","    \"\",\n","    \"## Próximo paso\",\n","    \"\",\n","    (\n","        \"Notebook 59: descargar únicamente las series Sagittal T1 \"\n","        \"de train/validation, construir caché 2.5D y entrenar sin \"\n","        \"leer el internal test.\"\n","        if approved\n","        else\n","        \"Revisar los gates y rare_strata_report.csv antes de entrenar.\"\n","    ),\n","    \"\",\n","    \"## Límites\",\n","    \"\",\n","    \"- No se entrenó ningún modelo.\",\n","    \"- No se descargaron imágenes DICOM.\",\n","    \"- El internal test queda sellado.\",\n","    \"- No constituye diagnóstico clínico.\",\n","    \"\",\n","])\n","\n","atomic_write_text(\n","    paths[\"report\"],\n","    \"\\n\".join(report_lines),\n",")\n","\n","output_hashes = {\n","    name: sha256_file(path)\n","    for name, path in paths.items()\n","    if path.is_file() and name != \"summary\"\n","}\n","summary[\"outputSha256\"] = output_hashes\n","atomic_write_json(paths[\"summary\"], summary)\n","\n","print({\n","    \"outputRoot\": str(OUTPUT_ROOT),\n","    \"outputs\": sorted(path.name for path in paths.values()),\n","    \"status\": (\n","        \"APPROVED_FOR_NOTEBOOK_59\"\n","        if approved\n","        else \"SPLIT_REVIEW_REQUIRED\"\n","    ),\n","})\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-16","metadata":{"id":"p10-6-rsna-foraminal-split-16"},"outputs":[],"source":["# 14) Gate final de cierre\n","required_outputs = list(paths.values())\n","missing_outputs = [\n","    str(path) for path in required_outputs if not path.is_file()\n","]\n","if missing_outputs:\n","    raise RuntimeError(\n","        \"Faltan outputs del Notebook 58:\\n- \"\n","        + \"\\n- \".join(missing_outputs)\n","    )\n","\n","for split_name, frame in split_manifests.items():\n","    if frame.empty:\n","        raise RuntimeError(\n","            f\"El manifest {split_name} está vacío.\"\n","        )\n","\n","final_status = (\n","    \"APPROVED_FOR_NOTEBOOK_59\"\n","    if approved\n","    else \"SPLIT_REVIEW_REQUIRED\"\n",")\n","print({\n","    \"status\": final_status,\n","    \"approved\": approved,\n","    \"nextNotebook\": 59 if approved else None,\n","    \"splitPolicy\": split_policy,\n","    \"internalTestSealed\": True,\n","    \"humanReviewRequired\": True,\n","    \"notClinicalDiagnosis\": True,\n","    \"officialTestAccessed\": False,\n","})\n"]}],"metadata":{"colab":{"name":"58_P10_6_RSNA_foraminal_internal_split.ipynb","provenance":[]},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}